      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Would love this to be available, Sometimes i have vrc just open when working on an avatar and having to deal with constant invites is a pain\nResults based on current status\nWhen orange:  \"you never accept my invites!\"\nWhen red: \"you're never available!\"\nHaving a hidden status would make it possible to just keep running vrc without anyone being any wiser. Other options would be the use of smurf accounts with 0 friends but that's not ideal either.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
