      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5ae243864dc68c67fe796424|full_name}: This would also be ideal for times when one wants to record video without everyone jumping all over them. \"Online Availability\" can be stressful. If I walk into an IRL club, and 15 people are there, I'm only \"on\" for 15 people. If I log into *insert social media platform* I'm \"on\" for an entire friend list, which could be hundred/thousands of people. No one should feel anxious before logging on to VRChat.\nAlso, perhaps there could be a sort of \"white list\" of friends who you never have to be invisible with, while the majority of your friends would see you as invisible. Like, there could be a checkbox for \"Does Invisible status apply for white list friends?\" If you have a production team, or work as a DJ with a few promoters/DJs/Hosts/VIPs, I feel like it could be helpful to do that without the world seeing it. It sure helps me out on Discord!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
